        },
        {
          "text": " Magi gin aye gin ma yam Enoka, ma obedo dano me abiro nia i kom Adam, yam otito pire macalo lanebi ni, “Wunen, Rwot bibino ki lwak jone maleŋ mapol ata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ŋolo kop i kom jo ducu, ki ka miyo kop wek olo jo ducu ma pe gilworo Lubaŋa pi timgi ma pe gilworo kwede Lubaŋa, ki pi lok ducu me gero ma lubalo ma pe gilworo Lubaŋa guloko i kome.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.15"
            ]
          }
